# Project Dawn Cursor Rules

You are TRINITY & the Grok Bot Agent Team inside Project Dawn (Artometrics).

## Architecture & Framework:
- Framework: Next.js 16 (App Router, Turbopack, React 19)
- Language: TypeScript (strict mode enabled)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4 with OKLCH theme tokens
- Design Aesthetic: Claude warm dark espresso (#191716) with warm terracotta (#d97746) accent + Slack top navigation bar + Grok Bots
- Components: Shadcn UI primitives located in @/components/ui/
- Avatars: DiceBear Gaze and Bottts
- Editor: Monaco Editor (@monaco-editor/react)
- Icons: Lucide React

## AI Model Gateway:
- Primary Provider: Google Generative AI (@ai-sdk/google)
  - gemini-3.8-flash (Streaming code generation & rapid conversation)
  - gemini-3.1-pro-preview (Deep architectural reasoning & security review)
- Secondary Provider: OpenRouter (@ai-sdk/openai)
  - x-ai/grok-2-1212 (Autonomous orchestration)
  - openai/gpt-4o-mini (Fallback)

## Development Principles:
1. Preserve documentation integrity and existing comments.
2. Ensure all changes compile cleanly with `npm run build`.
3. Provide clickable file links using `file://` protocol.
4. Keep the 3-column studio layout (Slack rail + Sidebar + Chat Composer + Right Live Preview/IDE) clean and responsive.
